CPU throughput (2 TFLOPS FP32) is based on Zen 2 (7 nm) and is within the range of listed configurations <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib56" title="" class="ltx_ref">45</a>, <a href="#bib.bib55" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite>.
