SSD-CIM I8 MAC throughput (1 TB/s) is from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">46</a>]</cite> (determined by peak internal read bandwidth), scaled assuming the capacity from Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table A.4 ‣ Capacity. ‣ Appendix A System Modeling Parameters ‣ LLM Inference in a Flash!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.4</span></a>.
